---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import NavBar from "../components/NavBar.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact ShipGlows"
  description="How to discuss, evaluate, or contribute to the ShipGlows product."
>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <NavBar />

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Evaluate the product, share evidence, or contribute.</h1>
        <p>
          ShipGlows is aimed at builders who already feel the cost of lost
          context, weak handoffs, and fragile agent loops. Start with the docs
          and repository, then use GitHub to discuss product behavior, report a
          problem, or propose an improvement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <article class="doc-card">
          <h3>Best way to evaluate the product</h3>
          <p>
            Bring a real workflow problem: repeated context rebuilding, weak
            thread handoffs, drift between docs and implementation, or messy
            server-side delivery operations.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="doc-card">
          <h3>What this is not</h3>
          <p>
            ShipGlows does not offer consulting, diagnostics, implementation
            missions, or human accompaniment. “Partner” describes how the
            framework behaves, not a service sold behind it.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Current Entry Points</p>
        <h2>Use the repo and docs as the first contact surface.</h2>
        <p>
          This site is intentionally light. The strongest proof still lives in
          the repository, the decision contracts, and the visible workflow
          mechanics.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/commandglows/shipglows">Open GitHub</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
